===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}} {{term|hostesse|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|frm}} {{term|hostesse|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|ostesce|lang=fro}}, made up of {{term|oste||host|lang=fro}} + {{term|-esce|lang=fro||feminine marker}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-hostess.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[female]] [[host]].
# A [[female]] [[innkeeper]].
# [[stewardess|Stewardess]]: a woman [[steward]] on an [[airplane]].
# a bar hostess or [[bargirl]], a paid, female companion offering conversation and in some cases sex.

